Mode A run of the unchanged AgentAvow native verifiers v0/verify.mjs and v1/verify.mjs over the pinned vector files, operated by aeoess (executed by Codex under his mandate, 2026-10-07). v0-verify.txt and v1-verify.txt are the verbatim stdout of each run (both exit 0, empty stderr). provenance.json states the runner, inputs, label basis and limits. SHA256SUMS.txt covers the other four files.
